  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Equation of tangent of parabola $y=x^2$ be <br />$t x=y+a t^2$ ...(i)<br />$y=t x-\\frac{t^2}{4}$<br />Solve with $\\mathrm{y}=-(\\mathrm{x}-2)^2$<br />$t x-\\frac{t^2}{4}=-(x-2)^2$<br />$x^2+x(t-4)-\\frac{t^2}{4}+4=0$<br />Here, Discriminant $=0$.<br />$(t-4)^2-4 \\cdot\\left(4-\\frac{t^2}{4}\\right)=0 \\Rightarrow t^2-4 t=0 \\Rightarrow t=0$<br />or $\\mathrm{t}=4$<br />Put value of $t$ in eq. (i), then $y=4(x-1)$.",
    "image": null
  },
